WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.782
Puss tapped his chin.

2
00:00:03.783 --> 00:00:06.657
The king wanted to meet Carabas.

3
00:00:06.658 --> 00:00:13.528
So Puss needed a plan.

4
00:00:13.529 --> 00:00:19.134
One day Puss visited the castle.

5
00:00:19.135 --> 00:00:27.085
The king was taking a nap.

6
00:00:27.086 --> 00:00:32.768
As Puss walked around, he heard music.

7
00:00:32.769 --> 00:00:36.518
"Someone is playing a guitar," Puss thought.

8
00:00:36.519 --> 00:00:43.286
"It's . . . beautiful!"

9
00:00:43.287 --> 00:00:49.244
Puss followed the sound through the castle.

10
00:00:49.245 --> 00:00:53.712
He came to a doorway.

11
00:00:53.713 --> 00:00:58.097
Puss saw a young woman with a guitar.

12
00:00:58.098 --> 00:01:02.764
Her fingers danced along its strings.

13
00:01:02.765 --> 00:01:07.085
"Master loves music," Puss whispered.

14
00:01:07.086 --> 00:01:11.729
"I wish he could hear this."

15
00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:14.149
The woman looked up.

16
00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:19.358
"Oh!" she said. "You must be Puss.

17
00:01:19.359 --> 00:01:22.375
Father told me about you."

18
00:01:22.376 --> 00:01:27.068
Puss was confused. "Who is your father?"

19
00:01:27.069 --> 00:01:30.089
"He's the king," the woman said.

20
00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.862
"I'm Fiona.

21
00:01:31.863 --> 00:01:38.003
I was traveling and came home last night."

22
00:01:38.004 --> 00:01:43.188
Puss bowed. "It's an honor to meet you.

23
00:01:43.189 --> 00:01:46.173
You're very talented, Princess."

24
00:01:46.174 --> 00:01:52.756
Fiona laughed. "You are very kind."

25
00:01:52.757 --> 00:01:57.811
She stood. "Come. Let's walk and talk.

26
00:01:57.812 --> 00:02:01.137
Father and I were going to take a carriage ride.

27
00:02:01.138 --> 00:02:08.996
But he fell asleep."

28
00:02:08.997 --> 00:02:12.727
Puss and Fiona walked and talked.

29
00:02:12.728 --> 00:02:18.094
"She's clever and kind," Puss thought.

30
00:02:18.095 --> 00:02:22.565
Soon the king found them outside.

31
00:02:22.566 --> 00:02:26.280
"I'm sorry I fell asleep, Fiona," the king said.

32
00:02:26.281 --> 00:02:29.628
"Let's take that carriage ride tomorrow morning."

33
00:02:29.629 --> 00:02:33.516
A grin spread across the cat's face.

34
00:02:33.517 --> 00:02:38.085
Now Puss had a plan!

